#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\playbackCoreMixin.py:870
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\playbackCoreMixin.py:889
msgid "Transpose only applies to podcasts, audio books and jukebox tracks"
msgstr ""
"Transpozice se vztahuje pouze na podcasty, audioknihy a skladby jukeboxu"

